# The architectures plugin-qualification-records is built for, and the machine classes each one carries: every set
# under records/<class>/ goes into the package of its class's architecture, at /usr/share/omx/qualification/<class>/.
# debian/rules and the spec (through tools/sets.py) and tools/sets.py check read this file.
#
# One line per class: the Debian architecture, the RPM architecture and the class.
#
# deb arch  rpm arch  class
amd64       x86_64    x86-64
arm64       aarch64   rpi5
